# Desktop

- All deploy/test/destroy/scale paths go through `desktop/src-tauri/src/hypercluster.rs`.
- JSON status: `run_sync(..., "status", ..., json=true)` and `test --json`.
- Tauri events need `use tauri::Emitter`.
- Update `docs/guides/desktop-ux-guide.md` when UX changes; run `make docs`.
- Check: `make desktop-check`.
